<Defs>
    <ThingDef ParentName="BaseMeleeWeapon_Sharp_Quality">
        <defName>BEWH_EmperorsClaw</defName>
        <label>Emperor's Lightning Claw</label>
        <description>An auramite-plated Lightning Claw, designed after the one used by the Emperor of Mankind. A single stroke of this weapon could separate an armored warrior into so many pieces.\n\nMuch is said of the Emperor, but one must never say he did not sacrifice much to defeat Horus.\n\nIts power field flares in the grip of a psyker, dealing slightly more damage the higher the wielder's psychic sensitivity.</description>
