        <defName>BEWH_Fealty</defName>
        <label>Fealty</label>
        <description>A mysterious power sword wielded by Lion El'Jonson upon his return in the 41st Millennium. Drawn from the stones of Mirror-Caliban, this blade stops for no opponent - no traitor, no xenos, and no daemon.\n\nMirror-Caliban appears as a forest without end, inhabited by Watchers in the Dark (the diminutive servants of the Dark Angels) and Great Beasts of Caliban. The Lion discovered Fealty and the Emperor's Shield within the realm, and was able to use it as a passageway through space.\n\nLike its wielder, however, this Fealty is a replica, well-crafted as it is.</description>
